----
:'''March 7th:''' What's going on... How come we're back at the start?
:'''Fu Xuan:''' It's the messenger. She's interfering with your movements again.

;(Talk to Welt Yang)
:'''Welt:''' Of course I hope we can take her in... Or rather, I can offer a conclusion based on the most basic of moral judgments: Now that we've found her, we have to look after her.
:'''Welt:''' But naturally, I'm concerned about whether or not this places the Astral Express in any danger...
:'''Pom-Pom:''' The Astral Express welcomes everyone! Don't worry &mdash; do what you feel is right, and Pom-Pom will take care of the rest.
:'''Welt:''' Thanks... I feel more at ease now. I just hope she'll have a good time on the Express and not feel too alienated from the rest of us...
:'''Pom-Pom:''' Stop worrying so much! Pom-Pom will say it again: The Astral Express welcomes everyone!

;(Talk to Himeko)
:'''Himeko:''' It seemed like that kid was trapped in ice, but the substance doesn't share the same physical properties... How bizarre.
:'''Himeko:''' The crystals show at least six structures under differing conditions... "Six-Phased Ice." The galaxy really is an enigma.

;(Talk to Dan Heng)
:'''Dan Heng:''' Everyone agreed to take you in... I'm an exile, and by the looks of things, you might not have a home to go back to, either... But here on the Express, nobody is alone.
:'''Dan Heng:''' Himeko said that your vitals were all stable... she just didn't know when you'd regain consciousness...

